# CALL_PETS — his OWN tamed pets come to him (T6F follow-up). The whistle, the horn, the bell.
#
# Only a pet whose owner IS him: a wolf tamed by somebody else stays where it is, and nothing new is
# ever made, because "call my wolf" answered with a fresh untamed wolf is a stranger's dog. Finding
# his pets and bringing them is Java's (CallPets): a function cannot ask a mob who owns it and still
# act on the mob. This only says "call them", by tagging him, and makes it heard.
function effect()
    /execute as ${TARGET} run tag @s add mfam_call_pets_${KIND}
    /particle minecraft:note ~ ~1.8 ~ 0.6 0.3 0.6 1 8 force
    /playsound minecraft:block.note_block.flute master @a ~ ~ ~ 1 1.4
end
